<p>Based on vermiceli's annotated disassembly of Contra: <a href="https://github.com/vermiceli/nes-contra-us" rel="nofollow">https://github.com/vermiceli/nes-contra-us</a>. Thanks for the great work.<p>I ported it in two steps. First to C: the game logic is translated routine by routine from the 6502 assembly, and checked frame by frame against the original in the Mesen emulator. Then the C code to WebAssembly so it runs in the browser.<p>The cherry on top: online multiplayer, so two players can play co-op over the internet.<p>Source: <a href="https://github.com/epoyraz/nes-contra-us" rel="nofollow">https://github.com/epoyraz/nes-contra-us</a></p>
